/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 115 0 R
/T (Many people are unaware of the exact quality of water they use and often choose water filters without proper knowledge, which may not effectively solve their water problems. This project is relevant because it helps users identify suitable water filtration solutions based on specific water quality parameters. By automating the analysis and recommendation process, the system ensures better decision-making, cost efficiency, and improved access to safe drinking water.)
/E (Many people are unaware of the exact quality of water they use and often choose water filters without proper knowledge, which may not effectively solve their water problems. This project is relevant because it helps users identify suitable water filtration solutions based on specific water quality parameters. By automating the analysis and recommendation process, the system ensures better decision-making, cost efficiency, and improved access to safe drinking water.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
